.TH "FWD CONFIG" "1" "2026-08-12" "fwdit" "fwd config Manual"
.SH NAME
fwd\-config \- Inspect or update fwd's layered configuration.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fwd config
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect or update fwd's layered configuration.
.SH COMMANDS
\fBset\fP
  Set a configuration value without opening an editor.
  See \fBfwd config-set(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBset\fP command.
.PP
\fBrm\fP
  Remove a configuration value at one scope, revealing the
next-higher-precedence value.
  See \fBfwd config-rm(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBrm\fP command.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-example\fP
Print a commented reference config generated from fwd's own schema
instead of your effective one.
.TP
\fB\-\-schema\fP
Print the complete machine-readable JSON Schema for config files.
.SH EXIT STATUS
\fB0\fP indicates success. Any nonzero value indicates an error.
.SH REPORTING BUGS
Report issues at \fIhttps://github.com/Sid-MB/fwd/issues\fP.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBfwd\fP(1)
